# expect: takes no leading value
# `Column` carried no slot when this was written and now carries
# `Slot::OptionalText`, so `Column "a"` is a legal program. `Main` is the
# slotless one, and the sentence a user sees is `zdc-types`'s rather than
# the emitter's — which is why `view.rs`'s copy is marked `// unreached:`.
view
    Main "a"
        Text "x"
